---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="请求的页面不存在。">
  <section class="not-found">
    <p class="eyebrow">404 / Missing Asset</p>
    <h1>页面没有找到</h1>
    <p>目标日志可能已经移动，或者这条调试记录还没有写入。</p>
    <div class="action-row center">
      <a class="button primary" href="/">返回控制台</a>
      <a class="button ghost" href="/blog/">查看日志</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
